### Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable runtime

The GORE Mod Manager Windows portable and installer packages include unmodified
x64 copies of `MSVCP140.dll`, `VCRUNTIME140.dll`, and `VCRUNTIME140_1.dll` from
the `VC\Redist` directory of the Visual Studio toolchain that built the app.

Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.

Microsoft states that licensed Visual Studio users may redistribute these
unmodified files subject to the applicable Visual Studio license terms. See
[Redistributing Visual C++ files](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/windows/redistributing-visual-cpp-files?view=msvc-170).
These files are not covered by GORE's MIT License.

